<title>USA: Omaha hogs $2.00-2.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $2.00-2.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00-2.50 lower. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    60.00</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    59.00-59.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 1.00-2.00 lower. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3     350-450 lbs mostly 46.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs    48.00-48.50</p>
</text>
